title: 'CLI notify command: send messages via Telegram/Teams from command line'
updated_at: "2026-08-01T15:20:53Z"
---
Add a clawq CLI command (e.g. `clawq notify` or `clawq send`) that lets the user push a message to a configured Telegram chat or Teams channel from the shell. Use cases: alerting from scripts, cron jobs, CI pipelines, quick one-off pings without opening a chat session. Should support specifying target channel/user, message text, and optional parse mode. Should reuse existing connector delivery infrastructure.